lues.b", "label": "values.b", "type": "FLOAT,INT,BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "b"}, {"widget": {"name": "expression"}, "name": "expression", "label": "expression", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "expression"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 131, "type": "ComfyMathExpression", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"expression": true}, "Node name for S&R": "ComfyMathExpression"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [], "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [210, 88], "pos": [-476.0907897949219, 5774.65478515625], "widgets_values": ["8.0"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 310, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 154, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [310, 312], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "浮点"}], "size": [148.87167358398438, 26], "pos": [-501.5195007324219, 5999.0185546875], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 309, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "flags": {}, "id": 153, "type": "SoundFlow_GetLength", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SoundFlow_GetLength"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [279], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the young East Asian woman in <Picture 1>, preserving her oval face, fair skin, long loose black hair, softly arched eyebrows, warm peach eye makeup, glossy natural-pink lips, and intimate calm gaze.\n<Audio 1> is the complete selected audio clip for this 16-second target video, directly reused as the complete final audio track.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation + audio reuse] This cinematic music-video segment continues from the city-light reflection covering the apartment window. <Subject 1> confronts a layered version of her own reflection, then transforms the enclosed room into a suspended night-sky space, paced to the directly reused <Audio 1>.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3]): fully_preserved - her facial identity, long black hair, makeup, and inward emotional performance remain consistent throughout.\n<Audio 1>: fully_copy - <Audio 1> is reused 1:1 as the target video's complete final audio track.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video remains live-action and cinematic, with natural skin detail, controlled film grain, midnight-blue shadows, warm amber practical light, and realistic rain reflections. Do not generate spoken dialogue, subtitles, or visible text.\n\n[Shot 1] An abstract close-up opens with blue and amber city reflections flowing across rain-streaked window glass until they fill the entire frame. The camera slowly pulls back with small amplitude to reveal <Subject 1> seated by the window in the dark apartment. Her reflection in the glass is now standing while she remains seated on the floor. The reflected figure turns toward her first, then raises an open palm containing the same small amber glow. <Subject 1> watches in stillness, her breath, blinking, and restrained lip performance following the actual phrasing of <Audio 1> whenever compatible vocal lines are audible.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.100, the camera cuts to a medium side shot. <Subject 1> rises from the floor and approaches the window. The reflection remains a half-step behind her movement, creating a subtle temporal echo rather than a separate person. She lifts her hand toward the glass; when her fingertips reach the surface, the amber glow passes from the reflection into her real palm. The warm light travels outward through the apartment in thin branching lines, quietly tracing the floor, wooden chair, bed frame, and walls. The camera makes a slow arc shot around her as the blue night interior gradually dissolves into a dark, open space filled with suspended points of warm light.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:11.400, the camera cuts to a medium-wide frontal shot. The apartment has vanished, leaving <Subject 1> standing on a glossy black reflective surface beneath a low field of floating amber lights, like distant stars brought close to the ground. The rain has stopped; her hair and dress settle naturally in still air. The camera pushes in at slow speed as she opens her palm and lets the amber glow rise above her. It joins the other suspended lights, causing a gentle wave of illumination to travel across the dark floor toward the lens. In the final second, she looks upward with a small, almost imperceptible release in her expression while the nearest light grows brighter, creating a luminous transition into the next segment.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nNo separate ambience or foley is added. The target video's complete audible track is the directly reused <Audio 1>.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n<Audio 1> is directly reused as the complete audience-only music and vocal track for the full 16-second video."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1480, 6000], "id": 138, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [284, 299, 300, 309], "label": "AUDIO", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [-765.8319091796875, 5867.314453125], "widgets_values": ["1:52", "2:00"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 283, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "start_time"}, "name": "start_time", "label": "start_time", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "start_time"}, {